{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04085","headline":"扈从温泉同紫微黄门羣公泛渭川得齐字 · 苏頲","name":"扈从温泉同紫微黄门羣公泛渭川得齐字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虹旗映绿荑，春仗汉丰西。\n侍跸浮清渭，扬舲降紫泥。\n近临钧石地，遥指钓璜溪。\n岸转帆飞疾，川平棹举齐。\n傅舟来是用，轩驭往应迷。\n兴阕菱歌动，沙洲乱夕鷖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}